          "text": "Mr. Prime Minister Balen Shah ask your youth & Government to stop acting cool by pushing anti-India narratives globally.\n\nIndia has given aid worth around 4% of Nepal's GDP. Give them a reality check about the country that helps Nepal. India doesn't flex its might just because Nepal is a Hindu-majority country. Nepali youth need to understand that, otherwise India has history of breaking another country. \n\n#Nepal",
