      "text": "In a shocking discovery in Uttar Pradesh's Jhansi, officials found a hand pump dispensing illicit liquor instead of water during a crackdown on illegal alcohol manufacturing. During raids across multiple locations, the Excise Department uncovered an underground tank connected to the hand pump, allegedly used to extract and distribute country liquor. Authorities seized around 340 litres of illicit liquor, destroyed 4,300 litres of fermented wash (lahan), registered four cases, and arrested one woman in connection with the operation.\n\n#Jhansi #UttarPradesh",
